export anchor NeonArcadeStyle:
    number: 352
    screen: TeamChat
    name: Neon arcade
    idea: The chat as an arcade cabinet, with a glowing marquee, a black bezelled screen where channels are stages and people are players with pixel faces, and a control panel of big round coloured buttons for attach, emoji and send.
    base: dark
    palette:
        void: #07040d, the room behind the cabinet and the style sheet
        cabinet: #140b24, cabinet sides and sheet cards
        screen: #05030a, the game screen ground
        trim: #3a1f5c, dashed dividers and card rims
        ink: #f5f0ff, message text
        muted: #b9a8d9, labels and offline
        magenta: #ff4fd8, the marquee tube, the channel title, Send and the mention badge
        cyan: #3ff5ff, section heads, Attach and the thread token
        yellow: #ffe94f, scores, times, the current stage and focus
        lime: #9dff57, the NEW badge, ready and typing
        orange: #ff9a3c, the fourth player colour
    type:
        Labels in a monospace, Press Start 2P, ui-monospace, DejaVu Sans
        Mono, Menlo, Consolas, bold. Message text in system-ui, Segoe UI,
        Roboto, Arial at 16px. Marquee 30px at 900 with a two layer
        glow, names 13px at 800 in each player's colour, times 12px
        yellow, section heads 12px capitals tracked 0.16em in cyan.
    layout:
        A 1120px cabinet. The marquee is a purple box with a 3px magenta
        neon rim and glow, BRIGHTWORK CHAT in glowing pale tube letters
        with WORK in cyan, and a yellow coin slot with Player Mara Okafor
        and Insert coin. The cabinet body frames a black bezel with 26px
        corners around the screen. The screen splits into a 300px side and
        the feed, divided by a dashed trim line. Select stage lists
        channels, the current one in a yellow box with a triangle,
        mobile-release with a lime 4 NEW badge and billing-war-room with a
        magenta @1 YOU badge. Players lists people with an 8 by 8 pixel
        face and a state line, triangle READY online in lime, bars PAUSE
        away in yellow and a cross OUT offline in muted. A HUD row shows
        the channel title in magenta and Stage 2, Msgs 5 and Threads 1 as
        yellow scores. Messages have a 40px pixel face, the name in the
        player colour and a yellow time, then the text. Mara is labelled
        1P. Aiko's message adds tokens with a pixel thumb x3, pixel eyes x1
        and a cyan 3 replies, continue token. The image is a pixel preview
        in a glowing cyan frame with IMG and the filename. Typing is a lime
        caps line. Below the screen a control panel with a cyan top edge
        holds a drawn joystick, the Enter message field and three round
        arcade buttons, cyan Attach, yellow Emoji and magenta Send, each
        glowing with its word below. Below 860px the screen stacks, the
        joystick hides and the buttons spread across.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 22px cabinet padding, 14px bezel, 12px between messages.
    density: Medium. A full feed on one screen and big targets on the panel.
    corners: 18px marquee top, 26px bezel, 16px screen, 4px tokens and badges, round arcade buttons.
    borders: A 3px neon marquee rim, 2px dashed trim dividers on the screen and 2px token rims.
    shadows: Coloured glows of 8px to 18px on neon text, buttons and the current stage, and inset shading under the buttons.
    icons: 8 by 8 pixel art, faces, a thumb and eyes. States use a triangle, bars or a cross beside the word.
    focus: A 3px yellow outline offset 3px with a yellow glow.
    tone: Coin op playful, such as Select stage, Players, 4 NEW, @1 YOU, 1P and continue.
